&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:4pt;padding-right:0pt;line-height:10.5pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;ＤＴ弁護士法人　弁護士(現)&lt;/p&gt;
